Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on a journey out to see the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.24,0:00:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm on my own, I've\Nyet to reach the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So won't you come along with me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.14,0:00:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely then we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.86,0:00:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me now as we\Njourney on from sea to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,For that treasure known\Nby everybody as one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.44,0:00:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though they laugh and\Nsay it's just a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.68,0:00:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We are going, there's no doubt we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we can feel the\Nrush of energy overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It will lead the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.32,0:00:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep pretending that you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.26,0:00:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Books will only get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:01:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No guides for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.12,0:01:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not worry soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.52,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The rain will be gone with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.06,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your chin up, raise the anchor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's what you'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.71,0:01:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it time and calm the storm\Nthat you have built within.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.36,0:01:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and have never get number two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.48,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once tomorrow's wind picks up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.62,0:01:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We set stuff cause we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.84,0:01:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh enough, stand tall and\Ntake a look at one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.36,0:01:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,All the journey makes\Nme want to see somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,There are things out there\Nyou just won't believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.40,0:01:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.68,0:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't think for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.38,0:01:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.48,0:01:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.88,0:01:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Most will believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.16,0:01:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.32,0:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I am on a journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The world done on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.80,0:01:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,On my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got my group of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Together we've got our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.44,0:01:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Says your captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.10,0:01:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says it can't be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.36,0:01:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't even tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta just believe we'll\Nmake it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.02,0:01:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanna do it all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.66,0:02:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Together surely we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.94,0:02:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.80,0:02:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this moment in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.90,0:02:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.50,0:02:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take this feeling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.30,0:02:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.32,0:02:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.40,0:02:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancient elephant elephant fruit, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a rare power you nabbed there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.34,0:02:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew you had so many\Nwarriors at your disposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.06,0:02:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you want to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.52,0:03:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you boys can still cut\Nyour losses, master here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.86,0:03:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We got as many warriors as a\Nmajor nation, all ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Beppo, you gotta be all\Nstill under my care.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down—this isn't your fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,fight Not if I get a say in it, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be a pirate, but\Nthis land is still my home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And as his friends, we'll fight too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.78,0:03:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.69,0:03:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That don't impress me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.82,0:03:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It will destroy everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.46,0:03:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Try it and see what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.18,0:04:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's morning already?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.66,0:04:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't you, Karoo, had enough yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We continued our tactic of\Nrotating our forces in shifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dogstorm valiantly\Nfought through the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.30,0:04:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,while Master Cat Viper\Nzealously defended the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.86,0:04:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,it was difficult to keep up with Jack's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.80,0:04:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,reinforcements arriving\Nin droves by the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.50,0:04:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It felt as if we were fighting\Nan unstoppable army of zombies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,However, with perseverance, we\Nsteadily overcame the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet despite our efforts, there was one\Nthing that we simply could not overcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.64,0:04:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That man truly is a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So even this big dog duke couldn't\Ntake down that guy from Kaido's crew?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.92,0:05:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.34,0:05:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But the same applied to Jack as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He started to struggle, and\Nhe wasn't able to keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Juggling both of our rulers wore him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.18,0:05:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But on the fifth day, he\Nunleashed a weapon in desperation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.54,0:05:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A poison gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.24,0:05:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We stood no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.68,0:05:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Instantaneously, the deadly\Ngas spread through the land.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we ever escape such a thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was bad. We were powerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.74,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It swallowed up the entire city.\NWe were all completely paralyzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.40,0:05:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,paralyzed only those who evacuated\Nto the fortress were able to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,survive the assaults as for\Nwhat happened next I don't even
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,want to say it answer the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,question where do mongrels hide the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,They kept on insisting that we\Nwere hiding the truth from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought our land to\Nruin one Mink at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.20,0:06:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, when they found Master\NCat Viper and all of his men,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.20,0:06:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,they were still paralyzed by the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.24,0:06:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They tried interrogating them,\Nbut when that got them nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The mighty were brutally crucified\Nand subjected to torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.12,0:06:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Wano warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.62,0:06:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We would never hide a samurai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop this madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor people know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.94,0:07:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.62,0:07:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This massacre is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.16,0:07:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's its cruelty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.78,0:07:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember you, Karoo. Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.62,0:07:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After I'm gone, I'll haunt you to\Nthe day you die with my cat's curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.94,0:07:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The slaughter continued for an entire day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.80,0:07:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And on the sixth day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.34,0:07:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess he must have had\Nhis fill of destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Or grown tired of the same answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.20,0:07:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He left behind a few dozen men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.50,0:07:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And suddenly departed from the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.48,0:07:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're\Nall lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, in the end,\Nwe were spared by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have you been awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.82,0:08:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth became apparent after reading\NJack's obituary in the newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that was the jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The day that Jack\Nfinally departed from our
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.02,0:08:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,beloved land was the day\NYugarra drowned Doflamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.46,0:08:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I realized he left this land in order\Nto liberate Doflamingo from captivity.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They must have been bound\Nby some deep connection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.00,0:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.46,0:08:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,the ones who truly drove that rootless\Ncreature from our home was you, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.72,0:08:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He fell asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.82,0:08:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, I now feel even more\Ngratitude towards all of you, Tia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.74,0:08:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The day after Doflamingo was\Ndefeated was the same day we arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.44,0:08:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that...Zoro?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll warn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.22,0:09:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Landing here is a big mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.66,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.50,0:09:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and carry us!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.94,0:09:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You will rule this day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.06,0:09:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The gates broke?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Something nasty forced this\Nthing open, or so it appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.76,0:09:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This place must have been invaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,An invasion?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we in danger? Hey, Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here and protect Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll check out the scene,\Nno problemo, my man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but perhaps I should look\Nafter old Nami as well
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.58,0:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper Caesar. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why me too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.00,0:10:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.02,0:10:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This place looks abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.80,0:10:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no guard in sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.68,0:10:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What could have happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.58,0:10:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that voice come from her?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.34,0:10:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he definitely looks like a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.30,0:10:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Then she needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.68,0:10:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think\Nyou're going, Squirrely?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.10,0:10:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We just want to crucify you\Nand ask you a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brooke, can you\Ntake them out? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.36,0:11:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Soul Parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Iceburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.54,0:11:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Bokichi splinted!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.38,0:11:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brooke. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.36,0:11:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A talking skeleton and a floating eel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.10,0:11:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.50,0:11:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on with this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's gas everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.98,0:11:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are all these fallen people animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.88,0:11:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,They're the mink tribe, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.50,0:11:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We should head back to the forest\Nbefore we succumb to the gas ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like this batch didn't\Ncompletely finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.32,0:11:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you're not their allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.84,0:12:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Pedro.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.50,0:12:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.84,0:12:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg of Yugara.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.24,0:12:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Duke Dogstorm and Master Cat Viper are\Nin need of urgent medical assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Their lives are at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.38,0:12:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The world still needs them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.54,0:12:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You must help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.02,0:12:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Above all else, those two must live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't let them die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.76,0:12:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole country's been\Ndevastated by this gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.86,0:12:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting goosebumps seeing its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny, you creep?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That gas is named Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.64,0:13:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a concoction of my own making.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.58,0:13:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell'd you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What I said is that I made that gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does that make me the bad guy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.44,0:13:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't the one who used it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't wait till this guy's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.14,0:13:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you never made the junk in\Nthe first place, they'd be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.70,0:13:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you better neutralize\Nit with your power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and then you're gonna make them an\Nantidote and you're not gonna complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,considering how much gas\Nhas already cleared away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd estimate they have about a day\Nleft again, ah, hey, stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just assume the\Nunderdogs were the good
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.78,0:13:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,guys just so you know the\NMing tribe is well known
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.68,0:13:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,for their hatred of\Nhumans and their fighting
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,ability—maybe it's better\Nif they die the moment we.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we If we revive them,\Nthey'll rip us to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Rip us to shreds? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.46,0:14:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.74,0:14:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have been a\Nlittle bit gentler with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.92,0:14:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I saved you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.82,0:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That was Nami's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.68,0:14:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I get back here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.88,0:14:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you better have this poison gas\Ncrab cleaned up, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And why should I? Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to play games with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I hunt this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, cheetah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, just go. I'll look after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Brooke, keep him occupied!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.10,0:15:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuba!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Luton!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.76,0:15:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mowat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sheepshead, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.32,0:15:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, retreat now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Sheepshead has been defeated!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.42,0:15:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But we haven't found the samurai yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.78,0:15:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not come out, even\Nafter we pushed him this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.00,0:15:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Go report that there's\Nno samurai here! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.42,0:15:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Neutralize the gas already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.84,0:15:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no fun, but fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.22,0:15:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.64,0:15:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You happy now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.94,0:15:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Karoo, neutralizing gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.60,0:15:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough. Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.47,0:16:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.01,0:16:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Chopper Emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.20,0:16:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us make haste! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got no time to lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Cough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.58,0:16:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is dreadful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.86,0:16:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.46,0:16:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Caesar's weapon killed them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Damn shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.74,0:17:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Those scumbags pretty much\Nwiped out this whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The people who attacked us? How awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,At least Caesar was able to\Nclear the poison from this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.50,0:17:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Since they did something this drastic,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,there's a good chance there's\Nstill some enemies hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.98,0:17:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So be on your guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.36,0:17:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,According to Gas Hole over here, the\NMink tribe isn't too fond of humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.00,0:17:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but we might end\Nup regretting saving them if we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.32,0:17:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.54,0:17:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you two with Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.66,0:17:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, please! Let's talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.78,0:17:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She's weak from the gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,She has an explosive!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.82,0:17:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.82,0:18:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you, Tia!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My people didn't deserve any of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.56,0:18:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing to gain from slaying us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.20,0:18:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The person you're seeking isn't here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.64,0:18:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How much of a thousand-year\Nhistory must you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.62,0:18:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,do to destroy before your\Nbloodlust is satisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanda, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.46,0:18:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hurt them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.56,0:18:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,They saved me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Tristan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack's men left already! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.88,0:18:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They aren't with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.22,0:18:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They left?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,pedro wanda they didn't come\Nhere to fight their allies
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.18,0:19:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,using strange magic they\Ncleared out the poison
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.60,0:19:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,we are indebted to them\Ni didn't notice but
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,the smog is gone what\Nare your names tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.06,0:19:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,what are you doing let's\Ngo chopper I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.54,0:19:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's been at least\Na day since the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,To counteract the poison, they need\Nto have the antidote by 48 hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else they'll all die! What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.54,0:19:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna save everyone in the\Ncountry, we don't have a second to spare!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the hospital?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.40,0:19:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I need more supplies right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather anyone who's well enough to assist!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.94,0:19:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'm a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.96,0:19:41.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.87,0:19:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,want the help?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.40,0:19:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid that everybody would die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise, they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll need your help, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.70,0:20:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There, you'll feel better shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.76,0:20:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Try those eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.20,0:20:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get you workin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,U. T.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,saved our civilization.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.56,0:20:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we were strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will never forget the\Ncompassion you've shown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.08,0:20:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We will repay U .T. someday! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.18,0:20:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No need. I can't believe\Nthings are that tight. That's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:21:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,why you were welcoming\Ntoward us it makes sense now
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, that Jack jerk makes\Nme so mad. Someday I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.22,0:21:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,whoop him and Kaido too They\Nmentioned that he's dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.06,0:21:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially if Yutia had seen his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep talking, but I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.34,0:21:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Have something to do? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.82,0:21:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the sun's down,\Ntime for the night shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to examine Cat\NViper and the Guardians.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.27,0:21:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go by Warnie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Wanda, it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.52,0:21:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you tired yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I am a king's bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.20,0:21:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A king's bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.81,0:21:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a special position\Nin which I act as
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.76,0:21:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,a go-between for the\Nkings of day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm allowed to be active\Nno matter the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you're pretty important, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I must report to him that Duke\NDogstorm is alive and well,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.98,0:22:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,although he'll claim he doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.94,0:22:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.14,0:22:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.12,0:22:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, I shall go, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.22,0:22:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am quite fond of the\Nfellow to Master Cat Viper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.44,0:22:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I see it's a full moon tonight, but\Nfortunately for us, the clouds are thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.14,0:22:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a safe trip. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.64,0:22:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for making time to\Ngive us a ride, Carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,No biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.15,0:22:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm a king bird, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Wanda, you weren't done\Ntelling us the whole story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.32,0:22:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.23,0:22:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We never found out where that dumbass\Ncook and gas he scurried off to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I am better suited to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it frankly,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,the majority of the Minx are unaware of\Nwhat exactly transpired after that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.92,0:22:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Their land had already been ravaged,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and we didn't want to cause\Nthem any more distress.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.86,0:23:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The event that happened\Ntwo days ago was so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.14,0:23:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,utterly terrible that\Nwe've kept it a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.44,0:23:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please brace yourselves; I\Nsay this with a heavy heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.26,0:23:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,though my ribcage is most assuredly empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.20,0:23:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But I fear our dear friend Sanji\Nmay never return to our side, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.26,0:23:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.08,0:23:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Brook?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.24,0:23:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of crap is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He said in his letter that he would\Ncome back; we warned you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.08,0:23:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The situation's pretty complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He wouldn't lie to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.02,0:23:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe Sanji, end of story!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.80,0:23:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take it easy, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.44,0:23:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to catch you up to the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.76,0:23:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, Zo is known\Nas a Phantom Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.32,0:23:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a living creature,\Nalways on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.64,0:23:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can't exactly\Nfind it with a Log Pose,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.18,0:23:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,much less locate it on a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,we made a mistake and failed\Nto take one thing into account
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,as we were dodging the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.74,0:24:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,ship we gave
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.04,0:24:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,them vital info
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.02,0:24:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,how could we escape when they\Nknew where we were going next
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and unluckily someone from this\Nphantom island was aboard the
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,enemy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Long story short,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.80,0:24:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,the people who followed us\Nhere two days ago were the big
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.26,0:24:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,mom pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.52,0:24:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.46,0:24:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.00,0:24:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can count on us, mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.14,0:24:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Us two should be more than
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.32,0:24:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.23,0:24:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So is my homeland after all. Get out!
